    "band": "Low alpha",
    "hz": 9.0647
   },
   {
    "text": "The reason they are so similar is not some bizarre coincidence; they are in fact the same object.",
    "url": "https://www.nasa.gov/content/goddard/hubble-hubble-seeing-double/#.YpZyvYOZrRl",
